<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_legendarygem_05.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Celestial Dungeon Gear for Protection Paladins</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available strictly from Celestial dungeons &amp; August Stone Fragments in Phase 5 of Mists of Pandaria Classic, although it is very important to remember that because other gear may be obtained at a higher item level from raids, crafting, World Bosses, etc., it is not a true "best in slot" list but more of a rough guideline, and players should sim the gear they actually have available to them to determine their best combination of stats and effects.<br/>
<br/>[tab name="Celestial Dungeons" icon=inv_legendarygem_05]<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="celestial-dungeon-gear-2">Celestial Dungeon Best in Slot Gear for Protection Paladins</h3>This list represents the best gear available from Celestial Dungeons in Phase 5 of Mists of Pandaria Classic. Keep in mind that these items are likely to be replaced by their Normal and Heroic raid counterparts. With that in mind, this is not a true "best in slot" list, and instead should serve as a rough guideline for what to keep an eye on from Celestial Dungeons.<br/>
<br/>You can purchase Celestial Items using <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=3416/august-stone-cluster">
<span>
