<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Protection Paladins</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to get powerful gear, in particular from World Bosses such as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-celestial-court">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pet_tigergodcub.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> The Celestial Court</span></h3>Chi-ji, Yu'Lon, Xuen, and Niuzao spawn regularly on the Timeless Isle. Due to their shared loot table, it doesn't matter whom you kill. They drop item level 553 Tier gloves and leg armor, as well as Season 14 PvP items.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=99129/legguards-of-winged-triumph">
<img alt="Legguards of Winged Triumph" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_plate_raidpaladin_n_01pant.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legguards of Winged Triumph</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=99127/handguards-of-winged-triumph">
<img alt="Handguards of Winged Triumph" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_plate_raidpaladin_n_01glove.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Handguards of Winged Triumph</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="ordos">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_axe_1h_firelandsraid_d_02.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Ordos, Fire God of the Yaungol</span></h3>Ordos drops an assortment of item level 559 loot, covering most slots besides weapons and trinkets. Due to the big item level difference, each piece dropped will be considered a vast upgrade over non-raid items. Note that access to this encounter is gated by completion of the Legendary questline; thankfully, doing so on a single character on an account is sufficient to ensure access for all your other characters.<ul class="exclude-units">
