<del></del></span> Oondasta</span></h3>Oondasta is a world boss located on the Isle of Giants, off the northern coast of Kun-Lai Summit. Oondasta drops loot equivalent to Normal Throne of Thunder gear, making all drops a strict upgrade over Celestial Dungeon rewards.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
